| **Agro-Processing** | Mini-grids enabling productive uses | Central Sumba 95kWp mini-grid, Muara Enggelam | Scale productive use appliances | 7-8 | Sumba ginger/lemongrass processing |
| **Water Pumps** | Commercial solar pumps available | UNDP ACCESS (23 villages) | Expand solar irrigation | 9 | PATS systems by IESR |
