| **E-Mobility** | Limited off-grid deployment | Rote Island H2 DDF bus | Off-grid EV charging stations | 5-6 | Rote Island hydrogen bus |
| **Agrivoltaics** | Research phase | No 3T village pilots identified | Potential integration with solar PV | 3-4 | Academic studies in Sumatra/Java |
| **P2P Energy Trading** | Research phase | Gumelar District blockchain pilot | Village cluster trading platforms | 4-5 | Gumelar blockchain P2P study |
| **Carbon Credits/RWA Tokenization** | Carbon market opened (Oct 2023) | Verra credits for forestry projects | Tokenization of RECs and carbon credits | 4-6 | Verra Indonesia projects |

